The legal texts come from the official publisher of the Republic of Albania and from the Assembly of Albania:

  Burimi: Qendra e Botimeve Zyrtare (https://qbz.gov.al), the amending laws and the consolidated editions of the
  Constitution, retrieved 29 October 2026; Kuvendi i Shqipërisë, "Kushtetuta e Republikës së Shqipërisë" (PDF, 2006),
  read from the Internet Archive.

They are official texts of the Republic of Albania. Albania's copyright law (ligji nr. 35/2016 "Për të drejtat e
autorit dhe të drejtat e tjera të lidhura me to", neni 12, pika 1, shkronja "b") excludes legal, administrative and
judicial acts, other official works, and their collections from copyright protection. QBZ sells printed and PDF consolidated collections; the editions used here
were downloaded free from qbz.gov.al or from Internet Archive copies of it, and are reproduced with the attribution
above.

Changes made by Lexifina: each version was converted to one Markdown file per provision, one paragraph per line;
spacing, quotes and dashes were normalised; QBZ's amendment notes ("Ndryshuar me ligjin ...") and footnotes were
removed from the text and used only to check which law made each change; repealed provisions were removed; and the
versions were arranged as git commits credited to the laws that made each change. The wording of the law was not
changed. Neither QBZ nor the Assembly endorses this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
